 tional\nDetails: https://talks.cam.ac.uk/talk/index/273722/\nSpeaker: Prof
 essor Shailaja Fennell\n Talk Title: Revisiting Economic Security: an inve
 stigation of concepts and measures for the present day\n Time: 18:00 -19:3
 0 \n Location: Ramsden room\, St Catharine's College \n The seminar series
